"The member's work kind: planning (Planning & specs: Non-editing design: plans, specs, architecture, and any investigation that feeds a design decision); investigation (Investigation: Focused read-only research or diagnosis of a specific question, with no design to settle); routine (Routine implementation: Mechanical, well-specified, low-risk changes); complex (Complex implementation: Ambiguous, cross-cutting, or high-risk changes (concurrency, migrations, public interfaces, security)). Sova runs it on that kind's model and effort from this chat's subagent profile (its fallback when that can't run). Name one for every member; a model given for it wins."
